	(text "Chain k of the 74HC165 reads channels 8k+1 .. 8k+8 in the order A1..A12, B1..B12, C1..C12, D1..D12 (D0 = first).\nAll 74HC165 share SR_PL_N and SR_CLK, each Q7 has its own GPIO (SR_Q0-5): the PIO reads 6 bits per clock.\nThe 74HCT595 chain (SER -> U..) drives the gates in the same channel order, first register = channels 1-8.\nJ5 brings the light-load rails (RAILA-D, up to 50 V) and the pinball ground. Rail monitors: 100 k / 4.7 k to the ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e336062-419d-50e1-bead-918376ea677b")
	)
